# Autogenerated (optional: uncomment if you keep Unity under a subfolder and want to ignore generated IDE files there only)
# If Unity lives beside WPF, do NOT blanket-ignore *.csproj — your .NET project needs app.csproj tracked.
# Typical approach: ignore Unity’s .sln/.csproj inside the Unity project directory via that folder’s rules, or track Unity-generated csproj (team choice).

